1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:05,383
After a rival dark-web marketplace shut down, daily visits to Hansa grew eightfold.

2
00:00:06,144 --> 00:00:08,645
Hansa was an online market for illegal goods.

3
00:00:09,265 --> 00:00:13,588
In June, Dutch police secretly took it over to attract users from that rival.

4
00:00:14,228 --> 00:00:16,210
Buyers didn’t know who controlled the site.

5
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:20,972
During the operation, police recorded more than 50,000 transactions.

6
00:00:21,573 --> 00:00:24,955
They also sent about 10,000 foreign buyers’ delivery addresses

7
00:00:25,035 --> 00:00:27,716
to Europol, the EU law-enforcement agency.

8
00:00:28,357 --> 00:00:32,279
On July 20, police shut Hansa down and revealed the operation.

9
00:00:32,899 --> 00:00:33,700
The plan worked:
